    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2014680/extras/92912f8ab7d0cb529e33d90a5c9d7d44.poster.avif?t=1703846537\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2014680/extras/92912f8ab7d0cb529e33d90a5c9d7d44.webm?t=1703846537\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><br>Death Strikers are a Special Ops team, called after an accident in lab 23. The accident caused mutation among the lab's scientists and the soldiers protecting that lab. Your goal is to find out what happened in the lab and put an end to it.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2014680/extras/1f890a75b1dc685d2f573010a489a587.poster.avif?t=1703846537\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2014680/extras/1f890a75b1dc685d2f573010a489a587.webm?t=1703846537\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2014680/extras/1f890a75b1dc685d2f573010a489a587.mp4?t=1703846537\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2014680/extras/1b08d0f0b7717dc547b68e00f806e2e5.poster.avif?t=1703846537\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2014680/extras/1b08d0f0b7717dc547b68e00f806e2e5.webm?t=1703846537\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><br>Project Death Strikers has 4 different characters to choose from. Each one of them has a different play style. Each player has completely different weapons making them unique.<br>The game has multiple endings that depend on your choices during gameplay.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2014680/extras/3baba9fd261bc68173cc94d989f9024b.poster.avif?t=1703846537\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2014680/extras/3baba9fd261bc68173cc94d989f9024b.webm?t=1703846537\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2014680/extras/3baba9fd261bc68173cc94d989f9024b.mp4?t=1703846537\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2014680/extras/92f3b413f9a288b56d35d1944cbec8af.poster.avif?t=1703846537\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2014680/extras/92f3b413f9a288b56d35d1944cbec8af.webm?t=1703846537\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2014680/extras/92f3b413f9a288b56d35d1944cbec8af.mp4?t=1703846537\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>It has the following features:<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Local Co-op Gameplay<br></li><li> Multiple Endings<br></li><li> Multiple characters with different weapons<br></li><li> Old school Run'n'Gun action<br></li><li> Brutal Boss fights</li></ul>",
