e.<br>The game has multiple endings that depend on your choices during gameplay.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2014680/extras/3baba9fd261bc68173cc94d989f9024b.poster.avif?t=1703846537\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2014680/extras/3baba9fd261bc68173cc94d989f9024b.webm?t=1703846537\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2014680/extras/3baba9fd261bc68173cc94d989f9024b.mp4?t=1703846537\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2014680/extras/92f3b413f9a288b56d35d1944cbec8af.poster.avif?t=1703846537\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2014680/extras/92f3b413f9a288b56d35d1944cbec8af.webm?t=1703846537\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2014680/extras/92f3b413f9a288b56d35d1944cbec8af.mp4?t=1703846537\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>It has the following features:<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Local Co-op Gameplay<br></li><li> Multiple Endings<br></li><li> Multiple characters with different weapons<br></li><li> Old school Run'n'Gun action<br></li><li> Brutal Boss fights</li></ul>",
